   "text": "A twenty-two-year-old man has a swelling in his right scrotum."
  },
  {
   "t_ms": 4676,
   "end_ms": 6792,
   "text": "It is painless and non-tender."
  },
  {
   "t_ms": 7242,
   "end_ms": 10430,
   "text": "The scrotal swelling brightly transilluminates."
  },
  {
   "t_ms": 10880,
   "end_ms": 15251,
   "text": "But inside it is a firm mass that does not seem separate from the testicle."
  },
  {
   "t_ms": 15701,
   "end_ms": 19502,
   "text": "Any firm scrotal mass is cancer until proven otherwise."
  },
  {
   "t_ms": 19952,
   "end_ms": 23973,
   "text": "And testicular cancer may often be associated with a hydrocele."
  },
  {
   "t_ms": 24423,
   "end_ms": 26906,
   "text": "So the diagnosis is testicular cancer."
  }
